{"id":"5612f6febc1886d8","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-operator.md","title":"Modal Operator","display":"df-modal-operator — Modal Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-operator","aliases":["89-df-modal-operator","modal operator","模态算子"],"display":"df-modal-operator — Modal Operator","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-diamond-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-operator</span><span>modal operator</span><span>模态算子</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-operator — Modal Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-modal-operator-—-Modal-Operator-$\\Box,-\\Diamond$\">df-modal-operator — Modal Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box, \\Diamond\">\\(\\Box, \\Diamond\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box,\\Diamond:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box,\\Diamond:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq(\\Box,\\Diamond),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\in\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}})^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq(\\Box,\\Diamond),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\in\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}})^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 必然算子（necessity modality）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span> : 可能算子（possibility modality）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模态算子扩展了经典逻辑，使其能够表达关于&quot;必然性&quot;和&quot;可能性&quot;的陈述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 表示&quot;必然 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;、&quot;在所有可及世界中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 真&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond \\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond \\varphi\\)</span> 表示&quot;可能 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;、&quot;在某个可及世界中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 真&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在可证性逻辑中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 表示&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是可证的&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond \\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond \\varphi\\)</span> 表示“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\varphi\">\\(T+\\varphi\\)</span> 一致”（即\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 在相应算术理论中不可证）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模态算子的重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 是单调的：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash \\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi\">\\(\\vdash \\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash \\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi\">\\(\\vdash \\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 分配蕴涵：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi) \\rightarrow (\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi)\">\\(\\Box(\\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi) \\rightarrow (\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi)\\)</span>（K公理）</li>\n<li>必然化规则：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\vdash \\varphi\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash \\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\vdash \\Box \\varphi\\)</span>（N规则）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac33b0fe891fc14f\" href=\"?note=ac33b0fe891fc14f\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic\">89-df-modal-logic</a>：使用模态算子的逻辑系统</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>：必然算子的详细定义</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a>：可能算子的详细定义</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" href=\"?note=89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" title=\"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl\">89-df-kripke-semantics-gl</a>：模态算子的语义解释</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c0935403945ab4ea\" href=\"?note=c0935403945ab4ea\" title=\"89-df-necessitation\">89-df-necessitation</a>：必然化规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 1.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-modal-operator-—-Modal-Operator-$\\Box,-\\Diamond$","text":"df-modal-operator — Modal Operator $\\Box, \\Diamond$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box,\\Diamond:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-box-modality]], [[89-df-diamond-modality]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box,\\Diamond:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-box-modality]], [[89-df-diamond-modality]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"ac33b0fe891fc14f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic]]：使用模态算子的逻辑系统","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]：必然算子的详细定义","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]：可能算子的详细定义","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl","status":"resolved","id":"89ed9a6623b0dfc3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]：模态算子的语义解释","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-necessitation","status":"resolved","id":"c0935403945ab4ea","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-necessitation]]：必然化规则","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Box, \\Diamond","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box,\\Diamond:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\coloneqq(\\Box,\\Diamond),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{O}_{\\Box}\\in\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}})^2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash \\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash \\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\varphi \\rightarrow \\psi) \\rightarrow (\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash \\Box \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2006,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac33b0fe891fc14f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语法、算子和 Kripke 语义分别由 [[89-df-modal-formula]]、[[89-df-modal-operator]] 与 [[89-df-kripke-model]] 给出。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-operator]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-operator]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","0e77586c4dc7e03a","ac33b0fe891fc14f","89ed9a6623b0dfc3","c0935403945ab4ea"]}